    "body": "**Node:** Mental Health (`MH`)\n\n**Your comment:**\nDAG is looking good, well done on all the hard work. \nA few things to consider:\n\n-  I can't see any temporal aspect here and most of these things will be time varying at different temporal scales too\n- What about mental health of those an individual lives with\n- Diet\n- Genetic predisposition\n- Wellbeing (some people report poor well being but no clinical diagnoses of MH and the reverse can be true too)\n\n---\n*Please react with 👍 to support, 👎 to decline once the discussion has settled.*\n",
